003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e弋猎印记\u003c/color\u003e{/LINK}效果。\\n\\n\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e重击\u003c/color\u003e\\n消耗一定体力，向前方突进，对路径上的敌人造成伤害。\\n\\n\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e下落攻击\u003c/color\u003e\\n从空中下坠冲击地面，攻击下落路径上的敌人，并在落地时造成范围伤害。","skill_affix_list":[{"name":"一段伤害","value":"47.8%"},{"name":"二段伤害","value":"48.2%"},{"name":"三段伤害","value":"34.2%+31.8%"},{"name":"四段伤害","value":"75.9%"},{"name":"重击伤害","value":"111.0%"},{"name":"重击体力消耗","value":"25.0点"},{"name":"下坠期间伤害","value":"63.9%"},{"name":"低空/高空坠地冲击伤害","value":"127.8%/159.7%"}],"icon":"https://act-webstatic.mihoyo.com/hk4e/e20200928calculate/item_icon/67c7f71a/0a4af4ecb63b4741aa3e42d18a2a0c21.png","is_unlock":true,"name":"角枪驰弋","is_enhanced":false,"enhanced_desc":"","before_enhanced_skill_attr_index":[],"after_enhanced_skill_attr_index":[],"can_enhanced":false},{"skill_id":11482,"skill_type":1,"level":1,"desc":"循借猎人的本能，依据点按、长按，以不同的方式产生效果，并对命中的敌人施加{LINK#N11480001}\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e弋猎印记\u003c/color\u003e{/LINK}效果。\\n\\n\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e点按\u003c/color\u003e\\n向前方射击，造成\u003ccolor=#FFACFFFF\u003e雷元素范围伤害\u003c/color\u003e。\\n\\n\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e长按\u003c/color\u003e\\n进入瞄准状态，并选定前方一定范围内的敌人，在该状态下提高阿罗夏的抗打断能力。\\n长按结束时，对选定的敌人造成\u003ccolor=#FFACFFFF\u003e雷元素伤害\u003c/color\u003e。\\n\\n\u003ci\u003e莽撞的猎手曾向枪尖攀爬，随后，有幸熬过血的教训，领悟雪原的生存至理。\u003c/i\u003e","skill_affix_list":[{"name":"点按伤害","value":"286.7%"},{"name":"长按伤害","value":"358.4%"},{"name":"冷却时间","value":"15.0秒"},{"name":"弋猎印记持续时间","value":"15.0秒"},{"name":"猎者之准攻击力提升","value":"11.7%"},{"name":"猎者之准持续时间","value":"15.0秒"}],"icon":"https://act-webstatic.mihoyo.com/hk4e/e20200928calculate/item_icon/6a7ba982/f379eefb1c5e1b319e70b5abd66bc91f.png","is_unlock":true,"name":"伏袭霆击","is_enhanced":false,"enhanced_desc":"","before_enhanced_skill_attr_index":[],"after_enhanced_skill_attr_index":[],"can_enhanced":false},{"skill_id":11485,"skill_type":1,"level":1,"desc":"召唤信赖的好伙伴\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e图加林\u003c/color\u003e一同战斗，并将前方区域短暂变换为\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e轰霆猎场\u003c/color\u003e。\\n\\n\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e轰霆猎场\u003c/color\u003e\\n·持续嘲讽周围的敌人，吸引敌人攻击；\\n·每隔2秒，对踏入其中的敌人造成一次\u003ccolor=#FFACFFFF\u003e雷元素范围伤害\u003c/color\u003e。\\n\\n\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e图加林\u003c/color\u003e\\n·若周围存在敌人，每隔2秒，图加林将快速移动至一名敌人附近，对其进行撕咬攻击，造成\u003ccolor=#FFACFFFF\u003e雷元素伤害\u003c/color\u003e。\\n·若命中的敌人处于\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e弋猎印记\u003c/color\u003e效果影响下，还会激活\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e弋猎印记\u003c/color\u003e。\\n·图加林会优先攻击处于\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e弋猎印记\u003c/color\u003e效果影响下的敌人。\\n\\n\u003ci\u003e等待，等待到不再心焦，便有赤腹兰鸻飞越白桦林，迎接他的射击。\u003c/i\u003e","skill_affix_list":[{"name":"轰霆猎场伤害","value":"75.0%"},{"name":"图加林伤害","value":"50.2%"},{"name":"持续时间","value":"14.0秒"},{"name":"冷却时间","value":"18.0秒"},{"name":"元素能量","value":"70"}],"icon":"https://act-webstatic.mihoyo.com/hk4e/e20200928calculate/item_icon/6a7ba982/09c772d12eb05ca265681eb20ecb781b.png","is_unlock":true,"name":"守猎进踞","is_enhanced":false,"enhanced_desc":"","before_enhanced_skill_attr_index":[],"after_enhanced_skill_attr_index":[],"can_enhanced":false},{"skill_id":14821,"skill_type":2,"level":1,"desc":"{LINK#N11480002}\u003ccolor=#FFD780FF\u003e图加林\u003c/color\u003e{/LINK}进行攻击时，还会为队伍中附近的当前场上角色恢复生命值，回复量相当于阿罗夏攻击力的120%。","skill_affix_list":[],"icon":"https://act-webstatic.mihoyo.com/hk4e/e20200928calculate/item_icon/6a7ba982/e28394c6fed50dfb3c76055d529ae766.png","is_unlock":false,"name":"惊醒沉睡的林线","is_enhanced":false,"enhanced_desc":"","before_enhanced_skill_attr_index":[],"after_enhanced_skill_attr_index":[],"can_enhanced":false},{"skill_id":14822,"skill_type":2,"level":1,"desc":"基于阿罗夏的元素充能效率，提升阿罗夏的元素战技与元素爆发造成的伤害：每1%元素充能效率都会使上述伤害提升0.35%，至多提升至70%。","skill_affix_list":[],"icon":"https://act-webstatic.mihoyo.com/hk4e/e20200928calculate/item_icon/6a7ba982/c3d558ebc8c167a5571ba12f88dc10d4.png","is_unlock":false,"name":"告别冬麦与残叶","is_enhanced":false,"enhanced_desc":"","before_enhanced_skill_attr_index":[],"after_enhanced_skill_attr_index":[],"can_enhanced":false},{"skill_id":14823,"skill_type":